#. Description of the plugin
#: filebird-document-library.php
msgid "Display your documents and files in customizable list and grid gallery."
msgstr ""
"Zeigen Sie Ihre Dokumente und Dateien in einer anpassbaren Listen- und "
"Gittergalerie an."

#. Author of the plugin
#: filebird-document-library.php
msgid "Ninja Team"
msgstr "Ninja Team"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: filebird-document-library.php
msgid "https://ninjateam.org"
msgstr "https://ninjateam.org"

#: filebird-document-library.php:51
msgid ""
"FileBird Document Library (Lite) requires FileBird plugin to be installed "
"and active. Please download %1$s or %2$s."
msgstr ""
"FileBird Document Library (Lite) setzt voraus, dass das FileBird-Plugin "
"installiert und aktiviert ist. Bitte lade %1$s oder %2$s herunter."

#: filebird-document-library.php:55
msgid ""
"FileBird Document Library (Lite) requires %1$s or %2$s %3$s or greater to be "
"installed and active."
msgstr ""
"FileBird Document Library (Lite) setzt voraus, dass %1$s oder %2$s %3$s oder "
"höher installiert und aktiviert ist."

